          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observations of the slow movement of a gray, matte cigar-shaped object in the sky on two occasions: likely aircraft observations.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "f6996841b0d50e0498a2c7f4cbc9ee02e65912008e9f088d9b021071a1c08242"
